{"id":"92c3069508e692b04310b5c28c26f9f9dca35748","axis":"silent","repo":"elastic/elasticsearch","sha":"92c3069508e692b04310b5c28c26f9f9dca35748","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/changelog/162878.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+area: ES|QL","+issues: []","+pr: 162878","+summary: Return warnings for unknown indices or columns when creating or updating an ES|QL view","+type: enhancement"],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/reference/query-languages/esql/esql-views.md","lines":["@@ -71,6 +71,18 @@ Use the REST API to create, update, delete, and list views:"," * [Delete a view](https://www.elastic.co/docs/api/doc/elasticsearch/operation/operation-esql-delete-view)"," * [Get or list views](https://www.elastic.co/docs/api/doc/elasticsearch/operation/operation-esql-get-view)"," ","+### Query validation [esql-views-validation]","+`PUT /_query/view/<name>` rejects a query that cannot be parsed.","+","+{applies_to}`stack: ga 9.7+` To check the query without running it, set the `validate` query parameter to `true`. Validation is off by default.","+","+With `validate=true`:","+","+* If the query uses an index or column that does not exist, the response carries a `Warning` header.","+* A warning does not stop {{es}} from saving the view. The view is saved whether or not validation reports a problem, so you can create a view before the index it reads from.","+* The analysis uses your privileges. An index you cannot read is reported as unknown.","+* Failures unrelated to the query, such as an overloaded cluster, produce no warning.","+"," ### Reserved views [esql-views-reserved]"," Some views are reserved. {{es}} or its components create them, not users. A reserved view is marked with `\"reserved\": true` in the [get view](https://www.elastic.co/docs/api/doc/elasticsearch/operation/operation-esql-get-view) response."," "],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"rest-api-spec/src/main/resources/rest-api-spec/api/esql.put_view.json","lines":["@@ -30,6 +30,13 @@","         }","       ]","     },","+    \"params\": {","+      \"validate\": {","+        \"type\": \"boolean\",","+        \"description\": \"Whether to analyze the view query and return a warning if validation failed, for example because it uses an unknown index or column. The view is saved either way.\",","+        \"default\": false","+      }","+    },","     \"body\": {","       \"description\": \"Use the `query` element to define the ES|QL query to use as a non-materialized VIEW.\",","       \"required\": true"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/external-modules/esql-heap-attack/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/heap_attack/HeapAttackIT.java","lines":["@@ -570,13 +570,14 @@ public void testTooManyEval() throws IOException {","     }"," ","     public void testTooManyEval_withViewDefined() throws IOException {","+        initManyLongs(10);","+","         // When a view is defined, ViewResolver can do signifcant work with a large stack.","         Request r = new Request(\"PUT\", \"/_query/view/my_view\");","         r.setJsonEntity(\"\"\"","             { \"query\": \"FROM manylongs\" }\"\"\");","         client().performRequest(r);"," ","-        initManyLongs(10);","         // 490 is plenty to fail on most nodes","         assertCircuitBreaks(attempt -> manyEval(attempt * 490));","     }"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/core/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/core/esql/EsqlViewActionNames.java","lines":["@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@","  */"," public class EsqlViewActionNames {","     public static final String ESQL_PUT_VIEW_ACTION_NAME = \"indices:admin/esql/view/put\";","+    public static final String ESQL_VALIDATE_VIEW_ACTION_NAME = \"indices:admin/esql/view/validate\";","     public static final String ESQL_GET_VIEW_ACTION_NAME = \"indices:admin/esql/view/get\";","     public static final String ESQL_DELETE_VIEW_ACTION_NAME = \"indices:admin/esql/view/delete\";"," }"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/core/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/core/security/authz/privilege/IndexPrivilege.java","lines":["@@ -221,7 +221,10 @@ public final class IndexPrivilege extends Privilege {","         \"internal:transport/proxy/indices:internal/admin/ccr/restore/session/clear*\",","         \"internal:transport/proxy/indices:internal/admin/ccr/restore/file_chunk/get*\"","     );","-    private static final Automaton CREATE_VIEW_AUTOMATON = patterns(EsqlViewActionNames.ESQL_PUT_VIEW_ACTION_NAME);","+    private static final Automaton CREATE_VIEW_AUTOMATON = patterns(","+        EsqlViewActionNames.ESQL_PUT_VIEW_ACTION_NAME,","+        EsqlViewActionNames.ESQL_VALIDATE_VIEW_ACTION_NAME","+    );","     private static final Automaton READ_VIEW_METADATA_AUTOMATON = patterns(EsqlViewActionNames.ESQL_GET_VIEW_ACTION_NAME);","     private static final Automaton DELETE_VIEW_AUTOMATON = patterns(EsqlViewActionNames.ESQL_DELETE_VIEW_ACTION_NAME);","     private static final Automaton MANAGE_VIEW_AUTOMATON = patterns(\"indices:admin/esql/view*\");"],"additions":4,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/qa/server/single-node/src/javaRestTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/qa/single_node/ViewValidationRestIT.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,134 @@","+/*","+ * Copyright Elasticsearch B.V. and/or licensed to Elasticsearch B.V. under one","+ * or more contributor license agreements. Licensed under the Elastic License","+ * 2.0; you may not use this file except in compliance with the Elastic License","+ * 2.0.","+ */","+","+package org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.qa.single_node;","+","+import com.carrotsearch.randomizedtesting.annotations.ThreadLeakFilters;","+","+import org.elasticsearch.client.Request;","+import org.elasticsearch.client.RequestOptions;","+import org.elasticsearch.client.Response;","+import org.elasticsearch.client.ResponseException;","+import org.elasticsearch.client.WarningsHandler;","+import org.elasticsearch.test.TestClustersThreadFilter;","+import org.elasticsearch.test.cluster.ElasticsearchCluster;","+import org.elasticsearch.test.rest.ESRestTestCase;","+import org.elasticsearch.test.rest.ObjectPath;","+import org.junit.ClassRule;","+","+import java.io.IOException;","+import java.net.URLEncoder;","+import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;","+import java.util.List;","+import java.util.Map;","+","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.containsString;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.empty;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.equalTo;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.hasSize;","+","+/**","+ * Creating a view reports what is wrong with its query as warnings. A query that cannot be parsed is still rejected.","+ */","+@ThreadLeakFilters(filters = TestClustersThreadFilter.class)","+public class ViewValidationRestIT extends ESRestTestCase {","+    @ClassRule","+    public static ElasticsearchCluster cluster = Clusters.testCluster();","+","+    @Override","+    protected String getTestRestCluster() {","+        return cluster.getHttpAddresses();","+    }","+","+    public void testValidViewHasNoWarnings() throws IOException {","+        createIndex(\"view-validation-index\", null, \"\\\"properties\\\": {\\\"k\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"keyword\\\"}}\");","+        assertThat(putView(\"view-validation-valid\", \"FROM view-validation-index | KEEP k\", true).getWarnings(), empty());","+    }","+","+    public void testValidationCanBeSkipped() throws IOException {","+        assertThat(putView(\"view-validation-skipped\", \"FROM no-such-index-for-view\", false).getWarnings(), empty());","+    }","+","+    public void testInvalidViewNameFailsTheRequest() {","+        var name = randomFrom(\"wildcard*\", \"Upper\");","+        ResponseException e = expectThrows(","+            ResponseException.class,","+            containsString(\"invalid view name [\" + name + \"]\"),","+            () -> putView(URLEncoder.encode(name, StandardCharsets.UTF_8), \"FROM no-such-index-for-view\", randomBoolean())","+        );","+        assertThat(e.getResponse().getWarnings(), empty());","+        assertThat(e.getResponse().getStatusLine().getStatusCode(), equalTo(400));","+    }","+","+    public void testParseErrorStillFailsTheRequest() {","+        ResponseException e = expectThrows(","+            ResponseException.class,","+            containsString(\"mismatched input '<EOF>'\"),","+            () -> putView(\"view-validation-unparsable\", \"FROM view-validation-index |\", true)","+        );","+        assertThat(e.getResponse().getStatusLine().getStatusCode(), equalTo(400));","+    }","+","+    public void testUnknownIndexEmitsWarning() throws IOException {","+        Response response = putView(\"view-validation-unknown-index\", \"FROM no-such-index-for-view\", true);","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings(), hasSize(1));","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings().getFirst(), containsString(\"view [view-validation-unknown-index] query is not valid\"));","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings().getFirst(), containsString(\"Unknown index [no-such-index-for-view]\"));","+","+        // The view is saved regardless.","+        ensureViewExists(\"view-validation-unknown-index\");","+    }","+","+    public void testUnknownColumnEmitsWarning() throws IOException {","+        createIndex(\"view-validation-index\", null, \"\\\"properties\\\": {\\\"k\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"keyword\\\"}}\");","+        Response response = putView(\"view-validation-unknown-column\", \"FROM view-validation-index | KEEP no_such_column\", true);","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings(), hasSize(1));","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings().getFirst(), containsString(\"Unknown column [no_such_column]\"));","+","+        // The view is saved regardless.","+        ensureViewExists(\"view-validation-unknown-column\");","+    }","+","+    public void testUnknownRemoteEmitsWarning() throws IOException {","+        Response response = putView(\"view-validation-unknown-remote\", \"FROM remote:view-validation-index\", true);","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings(), hasSize(1));","+        assertThat(response.getWarnings().getFirst(), containsString(\"no such remote cluster: [remote]\"));","+","+        // The view is saved regardless.","+        ensureViewExists(\"view-validation-unknown-remote\");","+    }","+","+    public void testValidationDoesNotRecordQueryTelemetry() throws IOException {","+        createIndex(\"view-validation-index\", null, \"\\\"properties\\\": {\\\"k\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"keyword\\\"}}\");","+        var before = esqlStats();","+","+        putView(\"view-validation-telemetry\", \"FROM view-validation-index | KEEP k\", true);","+","+        assertThat(\"view validation must not record query telemetry\", esqlStats(), equalTo(before));","+    }","+","+    private Map<String, Object> esqlStats() throws IOException {","+        ObjectPath path = ObjectPath.createFromResponse(client().performRequest(new Request(\"GET\", \"/_esql/stats\")));","+        List<Object> nodes = path.evaluate(\"stats\");","+        // Stats are reported per node, and the validation request may run on a node other than the one queried.","+        assumeTrue(\"requires a single node\", nodes.size() == 1);","+        Map<String, Object> stats = path.evaluate(\"stats.0.stats\");","+        return stats == null ? Map.of() : stats;","+    }","+","+    private Response putView(String name, String query, boolean validate) throws IOException {","+        Request request = new Request(\"PUT\", \"/_query/view/\" + name);","+        request.addParameter(\"validate\", Boolean.toString(validate));","+        request.setJsonEntity(\"{\\\"query\\\": \\\"\" + query + \"\\\"}\");","+        request.setOptions(RequestOptions.DEFAULT.toBuilder().setWarningsHandler(WarningsHandler.PERMISSIVE));","+        return client().performRequest(request);","+    }","+","+    private void ensureViewExists(String name) throws IOException {","+        assertThat(client().performRequest(new Request(\"GET\", \"/_query/view/\" + name)).getStatusLine().getStatusCode(), equalTo(200));","+    }","+}"],"additions":134,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/AnalyzeOnlyQueryIT.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@","+/*","+ * Copyright Elasticsearch B.V. and/or licensed to Elasticsearch B.V. under one","+ * or more contributor license agreements. Licensed under the Elastic License","+ * 2.0; you may not use this file except in compliance with the Elastic License","+ * 2.0.","+ */","+","+package org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.action;","+","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.VerificationException;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.expression.function.EsqlFunctionRegistry;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.inference.InferenceSettings;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.EsqlConfig;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.EsqlParser;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.QueryParams;","+","+import java.util.List;","+","+import static org.elasticsearch.test.hamcrest.ElasticsearchAssertions.assertAcked;","+import static org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.EsqlTestUtils.getValuesList;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.containsString;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.empty;","+import static org.hamcrest.Matchers.equalTo;","+","+public class AnalyzeOnlyQueryIT extends AbstractEsqlIntegTestCase {","+","+    public void testAnalyzesValidQuery() {","+        assertAcked(client().admin().indices().prepareCreate(\"analyze_only\").setMapping(\"k\", \"type=keyword\", \"v\", \"type=long\"));","+        indexRandom(true, false, prepareIndex(\"analyze_only\").setSource(\"k\", \"a\", \"v\", 1L));","+","+        try (EsqlQueryResponse response = analyze(\"FROM analyze_only | EVAL f1 = v + 1 | KEEP k, f1\")) {","+            assertThat(","+                response.columns(),","+                equalTo(List.of(new ColumnInfoImpl(\"k\", \"keyword\", null), new ColumnInfoImpl(\"f1\", \"long\", null)))","+            );","+            assertThat(getValuesList(response), empty());","+        }","+    }","+","+    public void testReportsAnalysisErrors() {","+        assertAcked(client().admin().indices().prepareCreate(\"analyze_only\").setMapping(\"k\", \"type=keyword\"));","+","+        expectThrows(","+            VerificationException.class,","+            containsString(\"Unknown column [missing]\"),","+            () -> analyze(\"FROM analyze_only | KEEP missing\").close()","+        );","+        expectThrows(","+            VerificationException.class,","+            containsString(\"Unknown index [no_such_index]\"),","+            () -> analyze(\"FROM no_such_index\").close()","+        );","+    }","+","+    private EsqlQueryResponse analyze(String query) {","+        var parser = new EsqlParser(new EsqlConfig(new EsqlFunctionRegistry()));","+        var statement = parser.parse(query, new QueryParams(), new InferenceSettings(clusterService().state().metadata().settings()));","+        return run(PreparedEsqlQueryRequest.analyzeOnly(statement, query));","+    }","+}"],"additions":60,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryLoggingIT.java","lines":["@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@"," import org.elasticsearch.test.ESIntegTestCase;"," import org.elasticsearch.transport.RemoteClusterService;"," import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.VerificationException;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.expression.function.EsqlFunctionRegistry;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.inference.InferenceSettings;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.EsqlConfig;","+import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.EsqlParser;"," import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.ParsingException;"," import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.parser.QueryParams;"," import org.elasticsearch.xpack.esql.querylog.EsqlLogContext;","@@ -109,6 +113,23 @@ public void testLogging() throws Exception {","         );","     }"," ","+    public void testAnalyzeOnlyIsNotLogged() throws Exception {","+        setupIndex(\"index-analyze-only\", \"192.168.0.1\");","+        var parser = new EsqlParser(new EsqlConfig(new EsqlFunctionRegistry()));","+        var inferenceSettings = new InferenceSettings(clusterService().state().metadata().settings());","+","+        String query = \"FROM index-analyze-only | LIMIT 1\";","+        try (var ignored = run(PreparedEsqlQueryRequest.analyzeOnly(parser.parse(query, new QueryParams(), inferenceSettings), query))) {","+            assertNull(appender.getLastEventAndReset());","+        }","+        String failing = \"FROM index-analyze-only | KEEP missing\";","+        expectThrows(","+            VerificationException.class,","+            () -> run(PreparedEsqlQueryRequest.analyzeOnly(parser.parse(failing, new QueryParams(), inferenceSettings), failing))","+        );","+        assertNull(appender.getLastEventAndReset());","+    }","+","     public void testLoggingParseFailure() {","         String query = SET_SETTINGS + \"FROM\";","         expectThrows(ParsingException.class, () -> run(query));"],"additions":21,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java","lines":["@@ -206,6 +206,14 @@ public boolean async() {","         return async;","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Whether execution stops once the query is analyzed. Such a request returns the analyzed columns and no rows, and does not","+     * count towards query logs or metrics. Only {@link PreparedEsqlQueryRequest} can request this.","+     */","+    public boolean analyzeOnly() {","+        return false;","+    }","+","     public EsqlQueryRequest columnar(boolean columnar) {","         this.columnar = columnar;","         return this;"],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"pa